{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern\u2014a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld\u2014to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete Evolution! The Final Covenant Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlights of <strong>Official 1.0 Version</strong> comparing to the <strong>Early Access</strong> include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Class Depth:</strong> 5 new playable classes: Berserker, Mage, Hunter, Shield Guard, and Useless Person; 4 new weapons: Double-Bladed Axe, Staff, Bow, and Spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Gameplay Upgrades:</strong> 2 new game modes: Boss Rush\u00a0and Chaos Mode; 2 new difficulty modes: Iron Crown Frenzy\u00a0and Corruption Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Progression:</strong> Addition of Chapters 5 and 6, completing the ending animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Overhaul &amp; Massive Content Additions:</strong> Significant additions and restructuring of the Aura and Relic systems;\u00a0Expanded variety of random events, accessories, and secondary weapons; Over 50 optimizations covering character mobility, resource allocation, and balance adjustments; 4 new character skins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision\u2014timing, resource allocation, and positioning\u2014deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy\u2014fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades\u2019 souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe Torch\u2019s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder\u2019s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Executioner has been executed.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/7a3f6e3fe3c428e25e67b52cc5ecf351497a238e.jpg"},{"name":"Putrid Abomination","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/f0c187d4e99ed0e1c6cd4aedd5d12dd6eee744d0.jpg"},{"name":"Lone Prison Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/7b124b7c6a3e5be0d66da0abf8e87a899e56d417.jpg"},{"name":"Glorious Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/d6beeec6dc7f0e3b05d7e5e85904f3894029579a.jpg"},{"name":"This is a phantom, what are you hiding?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/80100d49aa383d7f09f95e55b9afef5e62783127.jpg"},{"name":"Drus's Downfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/0094c936a6b956177aa4585ed2708cb5dfa8cc45.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/e29ab85638a4c0c2a5032c933d4d90f921bdfa62.jpg"},{"name":"Weapon Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/35078b92cc0890c87ed1c400396e018938d6c28d.jpg"},{"name":"Skill Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/8f7d97ff9f99e48f04e0f105772f1b11eca16d71.jpg"},{"name":"Advantage is Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2735580/d0c6adb65f19de7ee6f317c76e62ea772df16c12.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2735580?t=1765505656","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765505656","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/aca93271cd104ff4bec744e9344f2aa01a6ba568/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765505656","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/aca93271cd104ff4bec744e9344f2aa01a6ba568/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765505656","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There will be frequent bloody battle scenes in the game."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2938130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Netherworld Covenant</strong> is a <i>dark fantasy 3D isometric action roguelike</i> centered on <i>precision combat</i> and <i>Soul Companion</i> powers to deliver a hardcore, strategically rich experience. Control the survivor of a catastrophic disaster, wielding the Nether Lantern\u2014a forbidden artifact bridging the mortal realm and the netherworld\u2014to forge pacts with the souls of deceased allies. Venture into procedurally generated labyrinths to challenge corrupted heroes and demonic lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/94ef9e81a1c87e8a00ddd0f859cb0fb0.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete Evolution! The Final Covenant Begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlights of <strong>Official 1.0 Version</strong> comparing to the <strong>Early Access</strong> include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Class Depth:</strong> 5 new playable classes: Berserker, Mage, Hunter, Shield Guard, and Useless Person; 4 new weapons: Double-Bladed Axe, Staff, Bow, and Spear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Gameplay Upgrades:</strong> 2 new game modes: Boss Rush\u00a0and Chaos Mode; 2 new difficulty modes: Iron Crown Frenzy\u00a0and Corruption Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Story Progression:</strong> Addition of Chapters 5 and 6, completing the ending animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System Overhaul &amp; Massive Content Additions:</strong> Significant additions and restructuring of the Aura and Relic systems;\u00a0Expanded variety of random events, accessories, and secondary weapons; Over 50 optimizations covering character mobility, resource allocation, and balance adjustments; 4 new character skins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/e6ae61ea6430e670f95c79252240eda0.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Beauty of Precision</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat prioritizes tactical mastery over frenetic combos. Parry, dodge, and execute Ethereal Dash to evade attacks, then counter with lethal strikes. Every decision\u2014timing, resource allocation, and positioning\u2014deepens the strategic depth of encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/5ff5cc170f207ee17e4c060ad1516581.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bound by Souls, Empowered by the Dead</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul Companion system offers diverse combat strategies, featuring four distinct spectral allies: Swordsman, Ranger, Guardian, and Rogue. Harness their abilities to phase through obstacles, ambush foes from the netherworld, or evade fatal blows by shifting dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/30984b69f11545c04e85ff14dba7f8e5.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Corrupted Legends Await</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bosses twisted by malevolent soul energy\u2014fallen lords, once-noble knights, primordial demons, and entities lurking in the dimensional void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/12414ff3ee17ae0bce708eafbe65d77e.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanctuary at the Edge of Realms</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the borderland camp between worlds, gather spectral allies, forge weapons tainted with demonic blood, stockpile resources, and piece together the truth behind calamity through fragmented dialogues. Will you redeem your comrades\u2019 souls or remain stuck between life and death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.poster.avif?t=1765505656\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.webm?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735580/extras/81dc4d49bc24d8eae0dc68f91edaef0c.mp4?t=1765505656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe Torch\u2019s light reveals no path to salvation, only the shadow of a gamble: as spectral forces tear through demonic throats, the wielder\u2019s name may yet become another epitaph on the Covenant Stone.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MadGoat Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"des